    ["32112"]={"进食","瞬发","|cffffd100在30秒内恢复|r|cff7f7f7f6|r|cffffd100点生命值。进食时必须保持坐姿。如果你花费至少10秒进食，则会获得进食充分效果，使你的全能提高1，持续10分钟。|r"},
    ["32121"]={"Choose Target (50 yd)","瞬发","|cffffd100<Do Not Localize>\r\n\r\nPerforms an AOE pulse for nearby enemy units. It will cycle through the list attempting to find one that does not have a Combat Mark (31887) and boost their hate towards that target by 5000.|r"},
    ["32122"]={"Choose Target (Not Flying)","瞬发","|cffffd100<Do Not Localize>\r\n\r\nPerforms an AOE pulse for nearby enemy units. It will cycle through the list attempting to find one that does not have a Combat Mark (31887) and boost their hate towards that target by 5000.|r"},
