    ["80554"]={"Designer Notes","被动","|cffffd100LEGEND\r\nNYI = Not Yet Implemented, talent has yet to be fully built\r\nPH = Place Holder\r\nTBR = To Be Re-designed, or To Be Removed\r\nNNF = Name Not Final, will be re-named\r\n\r\nDESIGN COMPLETION (1st PASS)\r\nBalance: 95%\r\nFeral: 100% \r\nRestoration: 90%\r\n\r\nTO-DO\r\n*Feral PvP?\r\n*Rebuild Thorns\r\n*Restoration health raid-buff\r\n\r\n\r\nWe appreciate your feedback.|r"},
