    ["159584"]={"召唤宠物","40码射程","瞬发","30秒冷却时间","|cffffd100召唤一只强大的野兽来攻击你的目标，持续直到主动取消。这只野兽每次造成伤害都会使你获得10点集中值。|r"},
    ["159585"]={"安装炮台","100 钢铁之怒","无限距离","瞬发","|cffffd100加安部署一台自动支配者炮台，向四周射出冲击弹。\r\n\r\n支配者炮台每1秒对遇到的玩家造成|r|cff7f7f7f589|r|cffffd100点火焰伤害，持续8秒。该效果可叠加。|r"},
    ["159586"]={"冰霜吐息","40码射程","2秒施法时间","6秒冷却时间","|cffffd100Shoots a gust of frozen wind at the target location, dealing Frost damage to enemies within a 6 yard radius and forms a pool of frost that deals Frost damage to enemies that stand within it every 3 sec. for 9秒.|r"},
    ["159587"]={"冰霜吐息","无限距离","瞬发","|cffffd100Shoots a gust of frozen wind at the target location, dealing Frost damage to enemies within a 8 yard radius and freezing them in place for up to 6 seconds. Damage caused may interrupt the effect.|r"},
