    ["271262"]={"艾泽里特力量叠加模板","瞬发","|cffffd100Spell description. This does 3 extra damage. [DNT]|r"},
    ["271263"]={"无常","被动","|cffffd100H T1 N-Zero\r\nPoints: 5\r\nMy parent has been changed. |r"},
