    ["281169"]={"Throw Paper Zeppelin","40码射程","瞬发","|cffffd100Throw the zeppelin to a friendly player.   If they have free room in their pack they will catch it!|r"},
    ["281178"]={"愤怒之剑","瞬发","|cffffd100战争艺术重置公正之剑的冷却时间的几率提高100%，并会使其伤害提高25%。|r"},
