    ["327374"]={"Star Shower","瞬发","|cFFE6CC80Throughput Conduit|r|cffffd100\r\n\r\nStarfall extends the duration of your active Moonfires on enemies within the area by |r|cFFFFFFFF4 sec|r|cffffd100.|r"},
    ["327376"]={"Chase the Sun","瞬发","|cFFE6CC80Throughput Conduit|r|cffffd100\r\n\r\nEntering Solar Eclipse increases the damage and Astral Power generation of your next Wrath by |r|cFFFFFFFF50%|r|cffffd100.|r"},
