    ["327382"]={"Continuing Stampede","瞬发","|cFFE6CC80Utility Conduit|r|cffffd100\r\n\r\nWhen Stampeding Roar ends, it continues to increase movement speed by |r|cFFFFFFFF10%|r|cffffd100 for 8 sec.|r"},
